<title>USA: Snyder backs FY97 estimate of $0.40/share.</title>
<headline>Snyder backs FY97 estimate of $0.40/share.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Synder Communications Inc Chairman Daniel Snyder on Thursday said he was comfortable with analyst estimates that the company would post earnings of $0.40 per share for fiscal 1997 and $0.65 per share in 1998.</p>
</text>
